# Claws Out's affinity counts only the Cats you control (CR 702.41a). Bot2's Ajani's Pridemate is a Cat, so it gives Bot1 no
# discount: with Black Lotus and Mox Pearl (four mana) the {3}{W}{W} cast is refused, and with Mox Sapphire for a fifth it is
# accepted. Bot1's Memnite becomes 3/3 until end of turn (CR 611.2c) and is a 1/1 again when Bot2's turn 4 begins; Bot2's own
# creature is not pumped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Memnite
Claws Out
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Ajani's Pridemate
